---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="ab-mission">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="ab-mg">
      <div class="ab-mt">
        <div class="eyebrow">Our Mission</div>
        <h2>HELPING VETERANS <span class="red">FIND PURPOSE</span> AFTER SERVICE.</h2>
        <p>
          Alabama Veteran exists to empower and uplift our veteran community and their families
          across the state.
        </p>
        <p>
          We stand ready to guide every veteran in Alabama with access and direction to a wide range
          of resources so they can connect with other Veterans, engage in meaningful volunteer
          activities, and successfully navigate their next mission: civilian life.
        </p>
        <p>
          Since 2016, volunteers and donors have sustained the mission. Current governance and
          financial claims must be sourced from approved organizational records before publication.
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 28px">
          <a href={`${base}about/`} class="btn-r">About Us</a><button
            class="btn-b"
            onclick="document.getElementById('board').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' })"
          >
            Meet the Board</button
          ><a
            href="https://projects.propublica.org/nonprofits/organizations/813938705/"
            class="btn-ow"
            style="color: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue)"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Our Financials</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-photo">
        <img
          src="https://alabamaveteran.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/1G3A0224.png"
          alt="Alabama Veteran Community"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
